## 3. Suggested KPI Metrics (Cards Row)

| KPI | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **Total Sales** | Headline revenue figure |
| **Total Profit** | Headline profitability figure |
| **Profit Margin %** | Efficiency of converting sales to profit |
| **Total Orders** | Volume of transactions |
| **Avg Order Value (AOV)** | Spend per transaction, tracks basket size |
| **Total Units Sold** | Volume metric independent of price |
| **Avg Discount %** | Monitors discounting behavior/margin erosion |
| **Sales YoY %** | Growth trend vs. prior year |

Use **Card** or **KPI** visuals with conditional formatting (green/red) for YoY growth
and margin thresholds (e.g., red if margin < 20%).

---

## 4. Dashboard Pages & Layout

### Page 1 — Executive Overview
- **Top strip:** 6 KPI cards (Total Sales, Total Profit, Margin %, Orders, AOV, YoY %)
- **Center-left:** Line/area chart — *Monthly Sales & Profit Trend* (dual axis)
- **Center-right:** Donut/Pie chart — *Sales Share by Category*
- **Bottom-left:** Bar chart — *Sales by Region*
- **Bottom-right:** Map visual (or filled map) — *Sales by State*
- **Slicers panel (left rail):** Date range (between slider), Region, Category, Product

### Page 2 — Product & Category Performance
- **Top:** Matrix/table — Category → Product drill-down with Sales, Profit, Margin %,
  Units Sold (conditional formatting data bars on Sales and Margin %)
- **Top-right:** Bar chart — *Top 10 Products by Revenue*
- **Bottom-left:** Scatter chart — *Sales vs. Profit Margin by Product* (bubble size =
  Units Sold) to spot high-volume/low-margin items
- **Bottom-right:** Bar chart — *Bottom 10 Products by Margin %* (underperformers)

### Page 3 — Regional & Customer Insights
- **Top-left:** Filled map — *Profit by State*
- **Top-right:** Bar chart — *Sales by Region* with Region slicer synced
- **Bottom-left:** Table — *Top 20 Customers by Lifetime Sales* with AOV column
- **Bottom-right:** Column chart — *Repeat vs One-time Customers*

### Page 4 — Discounts & Order Trends
- **Top:** Line chart — *Cumulative Sales Over Time*
- **Bottom-left:** Clustered bar — *Margin % by Discount Band*
- **Bottom-right:** Histogram/column — *Order Quantity Distribution*

